Here’s a modern and comprehensive .gitignore file suitable for a Flask Python project (2024–2026 style):
gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
pip-log.txt
pip-delete-this-directory.txt
.pytest_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.nox/
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
.pytype/
.pyre/
*.egg-info/
dist/
build/
eggs/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg
*.eggs
.env
.flaskenv
.venv
*.swp
*.env*
